<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money mkt shortage at 5.661 bln rand Thur.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money mkt shortage at 5.661 bln rand Thur.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage rose to 5.661 billion rand on Thursday from 5.278 billion rand on Wednesday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
